abstract: "Supporting Lean proofs of finite allocation transitions, measure-theoretic expectation bounds, and continuous root-preservation lemmas, dependency pins, axiom auditing, and exact-arithmetic checks for the accompanying paper on envy-free division. The complete main oracle theorems are not fully formalized."
